<li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fog of War</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 Maps, Areas, &amp; Lands to Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Quality/Hand Drawn Graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[i]Inspired by games and movies such as Warbands: Bushido, Sengoku, Sengoku Jidai: Shadow of the Shogun, Total War: Shogun 2, Ronin, Mount &amp; Blade: Warband, Sword of the Samurai, 13 Assassins, and many more![/i]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keywords: samurai, sengoku, sandbox, rpg, survival, exploration, open world, base building, indie, management, scavenging, build, japan, character creation, jrpg, adventure, pixel graphics.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/485360/extras/0ba98e52a82525584232d127449e013d.avif?t=1783696880\" width=616 height=190 /></span><br>[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*A game made by a single developer.*</p>",
